      "content": "idk im just really scared of hospitals and the wait times are always terrible. i have some sumatriptan left over from my last migraine and some extra strength tylenol... do u think its safe if i just take a bunch of those now so i can sleep it off? if it's just a migraine those should knock it out right?",
